<title>CHILE: Chile's Iansa nine month net stable.</title>
<headline>Chile's Iansa nine month net stable.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean sugar-producer Empresas Iansa SA reported the following results in the first nine months of the year.</p>
<p>				 9-mo 1996	  9-mo 1995</p>
<p> Net earnings		    16.50	     16.51</p>
<p> Operating profit		 0.60	     17.05</p>
<p> Non-operating profit	  15.91		1.63</p>
<p> Revenues			  45.10	    161.50</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in billions of Chilean pesos.</p>
<p>-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-672-8800</p>
</text>
